{"text":"I have come up with two answers. On this wonderful day when we are gathered together to celebrate your academic success, I have decided to talk to you about the benefits of failure. And as you stand on the threshold of what is sometimes called real life, I want to extol the crucial importance of imagination. These may seem quixotic or paradoxical choices, but bear with me. Looking back at the 21-year-old that I was at graduation is a slightly uncomfortable experience for the 42-year-old that she has become. Half my lifetime ago, I was striking an uneasy balance between the ambition I had for myself and what those closest to me expected of me.","words":[{"text":"I","start":0.0,"end":0.78},{"text":"have","start":0.78,"end":0.88},{"text":"come","start":0.88,"end":1.08},{"text":"up","start":1.08,"end":1.24},{"text":"with","start":1.24,"end":1.38},{"text":"two","start":1.38,"end":1.62},{"text":"answers","start":1.62,"end":2.14,"punct":"."},{"text":"On","start":3.44,"end":3.68},{"text":"this","start":3.68,"end":3.88},{"text":"wonderful","start":3.88,"end":4.26},{"text":"day","start":4.26,"end":4.64},{"text":"when","start":4.64,"end":4.84},{"text":"we","start":4.84,"end":5.0},{"text":"are","start":5.0,"end":5.1},{"text":"gathered","start":5.1,"end":5.4},{"text":"together","start":5.4,"end":5.82},{"text":"to","start":5.82,"end":6.24},{"text":"celebrate","start":6.24,"end":6.6},{"text":"your","start":6.6,"end":6.98},{"text":"academic","start":6.98,"end":7.5},{"text":"success","start":7.5,"end":8.08,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":8.58,"end":9.1},{"text":"have","start":9.1,"end":9.26},{"text":"decided","start":9.26,"end":9.64},{"text":"to","start":9.64,"end":10.0},{"text":"talk","start":10.0,"end":10.16},{"text":"to","start":10.16,"end":10.32},{"text":"you","start":10.32,"end":10.64},{"text":"about","start":10.64,"end":11.24},{"text":"the","start":11.24,"end":11.4},{"text":"benefits","start":11.4,"end":11.72},{"text":"of","start":11.72,"end":12.06},{"text":"failure"